            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A network node according to an aspect of the present disclosure includes: a reception section that receives information on willingness of a terminal to participate in work implemented by a network node, and a terminal capability related to the work; and a control section that selects a terminal to participate in the work based on the information on the willingness and the terminal capability.</p>
